      <h2>🎯 Why Prompts Matter More Than You Think</h2>

      <p>
        Here's the truth: Claude's power doesn't come from Claude itself—it comes from how you talk to it. A poorly worded prompt gives mediocre results. A well-crafted prompt? Game-changing.
      </p>

      <p>
        Think of it like this: Claude is a super-smart assistant ready to help, but you need to give clear instructions. The more specific you are, the better the results. And that's exactly what we're covering today.
      </p>

      <h2>📌 The 10 Prompts Every Claude User Needs</h2>

      <!-- Prompt 1 -->
      <div class="prompt-card">
        <div class="prompt-card-header">
          <div class="prompt-number">1</div>
          <div class="prompt-title">Master Your Personal Finance</div>
        </div>
        <div class="prompt-description">
          Want to take control of your money? This prompt helps you analyze spending, identify savings opportunities, and create a realistic budget without sacrificing quality of life.
        </div>
        <div class="prompt-example">
          Analyze my spending patterns and suggest 3 specific ways I can save money without reducing my lifestyle quality. Focus on realistic changes I can actually maintain.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Prompt 2 -->
      <div class="prompt-card">
        <div class="prompt-card-header">
          <div class="prompt-number">2</div>
          <div class="prompt-title">Design Your Fitness Transformation</div>
        </div>
        <div class="prompt-description">
          No gym membership? No equipment? No problem. Get a custom 30-day fitness plan tailored to your actual life, not some Instagram fantasy.
        </div>
        <div class="prompt-example">
          Create a 30-day home workout plan for someone with 45 minutes daily, no equipment, and looking to build strength and lose weight. Make it progressive and realistic.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Prompt 3 -->
      <div class="prompt-card">
        <div class="prompt-card-header">
          <div class="prompt-number">3</div>
          <div class="prompt-title">Understand Complex Topics Instantly</div>
        </div>
        <div class="prompt-description">
          Struggling with a difficult concept? Get crystal-clear explanations with real-world examples and analogies that actually make sense.
        </div>
        <div class="prompt-example">
          Explain blockchain technology like I'm a 16-year-old. Use everyday analogies and avoid technical jargon. Make it interesting and memorable.
        </div>
      </div>

